<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Flour Mills 1Q profits down.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Flour Mills 1Q profits down.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter result for Flour Mills of Nigeria to end June (In million naira).</p>
<p>				1996	 1995</p>
<p>Turnover		    2,700  vs 2,000</p>
<p>Profit before taxation   75.7  vs    97</p>
<p>Profit after taxation    53    vs  60.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said in a statement that increase in cost of production had a negative impact on its profits. It said the management had taken steps to enhance profits in the remaining part of the year.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
